sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as ShopPage
  participant API as shopApi/productApi
  participant Auth as protect Middleware
  participant SC as shopController
  participant PC as productController
  participant SM as Shop Model
  participant PM as Product Model
  UI->>API: submit verification
  API->>Auth: POST /api/shops/mine/verification
  Auth->>SC: submitShopVerification
  SC->>SM: findOrCreate + update verified
  SM-->>UI: operating shop DTO
  UI->>API: update shop or own product
  API->>SC: updateMyShop
  API->>PC: updateProduct
  SC->>SM: update own shop
  PC->>PM: ownership check + update
  SM-->>UI: updated data
